{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The development, due to the intensification of\r\nthe site and the lack of adequate noise assessment, would result in an\r\nunreasonable degree of impacts with regard to noise and disturbance to the\r\ndetriment of the amenities of neighbouring occupiers, contrary to Policies D3.D(7),\r\nD13 and D14 of The London Plan (2021) and Policies DM1, DM33 and DM46 of the\r\nHarrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;_Hlk199941162&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;&quot;&gt;The\r\ndevelopment, due to the maximum number of children it could accommodate in\r\nconjunction with the amount of floorspace designated for the childcare use, its\r\npoor accessibility and lack of adequate supporting evidence for the need, would\r\nresult in an over intensification of the site in an inappropriate location and\r\na non-residential use on site which, due to its scale, would no longer be\r\nancillary to the C3 dwellinghouse. The proposal would therefore fail to comply\r\nwith Policies H8 and S3.B of the London Plan (2021) and Policies DM33.A, DM33.E\r\nand DM46.B of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013).&lt;b&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
